OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1789670580
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/3
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV and Channel 4 channels move
OL,4,CFreeview mux
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier today, a number of ITV and
OL,7,FChannel 4 channels moved Freeview
OL,8,Fmultiplex, making them more widely
OL,9,Favailable on the platform.
OL,11,FITV 2 + 1, ITV 4 + 1, E4 Extra and
OL,12,FFilm4 + 1 have quietly moved to the
OL,13,FD3/4 multiplex meaning these channels
OL,14,Fare now available to viewers served by
OL,15,FFreeview Light transmitter sites, which
OL,16,Fcarry only a subset of the full
OL,17,Fportfolio of Freeview channels.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Sep-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14102
