PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1789670580
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/3
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV and Channel 4 channels move
OL,4,CFreeview mux
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe channels now use the more
OL,7,Fup-to-date AVC/MPEG-4 video standard,
OL,8,Falthough they continue to be available
OL,9,Fin standard definition. Previously the
OL,10,Fchannels were broadcast using the
OL,11,Folder, less efficient MPEG-2 video
OL,12,Fstandard.
OL,14,FThe changes also mean ITV 3 + 1 and ITV
OL,15,F4 + 1 are now available full time.
OL,16,FPreviously they were only available for
OL,17,Fshort periods of the day.
OL,19,FA rescan will be required to pick up
OL,20,Fthe channels at their new location.
OL,23,EPub: 16-Sep-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
