OL,3,GNEWSCITV and Channel 4 channels move
OL,4,CFreeview mux
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe updates were not included in
OL,7,FFreeview's official list of changes on
OL,8,F16th September. However, Channel 4 did
OL,9,Frelease a short statement about the
OL,10,Fmultiplex move.
